{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":-180,"y":-123,"width":360,"height":246,"text":"# 深度学习基础总览 · 重点 5\n\n学习目标: 覆盖模型结构、训练机制、稳定性、CNN、实战流程和易错点\n\n回忆: 能否按模型、训练、稳定性、CNN 和实战流程讲清一条学习链路","color":"6"},
		{"id":"model","type":"text","x":-640,"y":-2068,"width":320,"height":114,"text":"**模型结构** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 模型如何从输入得到预测"},
		{"id":"train","type":"text","x":320,"y":-1749,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练机制** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 参数是如何被梯度下降更新的"},
		{"id":"stability","type":"text","x":-640,"y":138,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练稳定性** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 初始化、归一化和正则化分别解决什么问题"},
		{"id":"cnn","type":"text","x":320,"y":-109,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**卷积神经网络** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: CNN 为什么适合图像，核心组件有哪些"},
		{"id":"practice","type":"text","x":320,"y":1613,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**实战流程** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 从数据到模型评估的最短闭环是什么"},
		{"id":"pitfalls","type":"text","x":-640,"y":1943,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**常见错误** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 遇到训练异常时先检查哪些条件"},
		{"id":"model-mlp","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-2821,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**感知机与 MLP** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 输入层、隐藏层、输出层各自负责什么"},
		{"id":"model-forward","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-2326,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**前向传播** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 前向传播按什么顺序计算张量和损失"},
		{"id":"model-activation","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1831,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**激活函数** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么没有非线性激活，多层网络会退化成一层"},
		{"id":"model-loss","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1336,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**损失函数** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: MSE 与交叉熵分别适用于什么任务"},
		{"id":"model-neuron","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2966,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**线性变换 + 激活**"},
		{"id":"model-matrix","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2636,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**整层矩阵化**"},
		{"id":"model-graph","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2326,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**计算图** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么计算图能复用中间结果并支持自动求导"},
		{"id":"model-relu","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1976,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**ReLU**"},
		{"id":"model-sigmoid","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1677,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**Sigmoid 饱和**\n\n条件：输入过大或过小\n影响：输出饱和、梯度接近 0\n替代：ReLU、GELU 等激活函数"},
		{"id":"model-ce","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1316,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Softmax + CrossEntropy**"},
		{"id":"train-backprop","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2326,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**反向传播** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 链式法则如何沿计算图反向计算每个参数的梯度"},
		{"id":"train-gd","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1831,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**梯度下降** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 参数沿负梯度方向更新时，学习率控制什么"},
		{"id":"train-optimizer","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1501,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**优化器演化** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: SGD、Momentum、AdamW 的关键差异是什么"},
		{"id":"train-lr","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1171,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**学习率调度** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 学习率过大和过小分别会出现什么训练现象"},
		{"id":"train-chain","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-2471,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**链式法则**"},
		{"id":"train-autograd","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-2141,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**自动微分**"},
		{"id":"train-sgd","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1842,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**Batch / SGD / Mini-batch** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 三种梯度估计方式的稳定性与成本如何取舍"},
		{"id":"train-adamw","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1481,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**AdamW**"},
		{"id":"train-warmup","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1151,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Warmup + Cosine**"},
		{"id":"stab-init","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-769,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**参数初始化** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Xavier 和 He 初始化分别在什么场景使用"},
		{"id":"stab-norm","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-109,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**归一化** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: BatchNorm 与 LayerNorm 的统计维度和适用场景有什么区别"},
		{"id":"stab-reg","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":551,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**正则化** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: L1、L2、Dropout、EarlyStopping 各自限制什么"},
		{"id":"stab-gradient","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":969,"width":320,"height":290,"text":"**梯度消失与爆炸** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 现象、原因和常见应对分别是什么\n\n现象：深层网络梯度接近 0 或数值爆炸\n原因：链式连乘与不稳定的激活/初始化\n正确：合理初始化、归一化、残差连接、梯度裁剪"},
		{"id":"stab-xavier","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-914,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Xavier**"},
		{"id":"stab-he","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-584,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**He**"},
		{"id":"stab-bn","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-254,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**BatchNorm**"},
		{"id":"stab-ln","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":76,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**LayerNorm**"},
		{"id":"stab-dropout","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":406,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Dropout**"},
		{"id":"stab-early","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":736,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Early Stopping**"},
		{"id":"cnn-conv","type":"text","x":800,"y":-769,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**卷积层** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 卷积核、stride、padding 如何共同决定输出尺寸"},
		{"id":"cnn-pool","type":"text","x":800,"y":-419,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**池化层**"},
		{"id":"cnn-receptive","type":"text","x":800,"y":-109,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**感受野** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 层数、卷积核大小和 stride 如何影响感受野"},
		{"id":"cnn-residual","type":"text","x":800,"y":221,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**残差连接** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 残差连接为什么能改善深层网络的梯度和退化问题"},
		{"id":"cnn-backbone","type":"text","x":800,"y":571,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**经典骨干网络**"},
		{"id":"cnn-kernel","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-749,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**卷积核与参数共享**"},
		{"id":"cnn-shortcut","type":"text","x":1280,"y":241,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**捷径分支**"},
		{"id":"practice-data","type":"text","x":800,"y":973,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**数据准备**"},
		{"id":"practice-model","type":"text","x":800,"y":1303,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**模型搭建**"},
		{"id":"practice-loop","type":"text","x":800,"y":1613,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练循环** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 训练循环的四步和每步职责是什么"},
		{"id":"practice-eval","type":"text","x":800,"y":1943,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**验证与早停** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 如何根据验证集指标选择模型并决定何时停止"},
		{"id":"practice-save","type":"text","x":800,"y":2293,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**保存与加载**"},
		{"id":"pitfall-overfit","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1382,"width":320,"height":268,"text":"**过拟合** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 训练集很好、验证集变差说明什么\n\n现象：训练指标持续提升，验证指标下降\n原因：模型记住了训练集噪声\n正确：正则化、数据增强、早停、增加数据"},
		{"id":"pitfall-lr","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1712,"width":320,"height":268,"text":"**学习率失配** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: loss 震荡或下降过慢时先检查什么\n\n现象：loss 震荡、发散或几乎不下降\n原因：学习率过大或过小\n正确：先做学习率扫描，再使用 Warmup/Cosine 等调度"},
		{"id":"pitfall-init","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":2097,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**初始化不当**\n\n现象：训练初期梯度异常\n原因：初始化尺度过大或过小\n正确：使用 Xavier/He 初始化"},
		{"id":"pitfall-inplace","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":2361,"width":320,"height":290,"text":"**in-place 破坏计算图** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么叶子张量上的 in-place 操作可能让 backward 报错\n\n现象：backward 报叶子变量被就地修改\n原因：计算图记录的值被原地改写\n正确：避免对 requires_grad 的叶子张量做 in-place"}
	],
